Z||000001||theogre||03-24-2000||07:25 PM||||I'm told code keys are free at autozone. all the cheap code keys come with code lists. none of these cost more than a few bucks if you can't get it at autozone. a paperclip works just as well.<P>Now if you want a real "ECM scanner" that does something besides christmas tree imitation then you want the AutoXray GM scanner. ((Unless you need to cover other product in what case you want AutoXray XP240 or one of the other universal scanner.))<P>read the other threads for the last few days. We cover scanner in a couple of them. Search AutoXray in general and tech section||||reg||1
